"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_YER_SONRASI:1076-01-01:0":{"b": ["Synod of Worms: Henry IV declares that he has deposed Gregory VII; Gregory excommunicates him", "36e0ddb4"], "d": ["The synod of German bishops that met at Worms in January 1076 declared Gregory deposed; Henry wrote to the pope as 'not pope, but false monk'. Henry was at once excommunicated; his supporters dwindled and the Saxons took up arms.", "a40f48cd"]},
